Target architecture:

AGENT / MCP CALLER
|
v
QP REQUEST COMPILER

   - exact desired claim
   - exact effect proposal
   |
   =C2=B1-> AUTHORITY PROVIDER (Grantex-compatible)
   |
   v
   QP EFFECT POLICY
   - prerequisites TRUE
   - authority valid
   - budget/payload constraints
   |
