L. THE RULE FOR ADDING A NEW PLATFORM
<p>Do not write a platform integration from scratch until these searches fa=
il:</p>
<ol>
<li>Does Monid already have the endpoint?</li>
<li>Does Postiz already execute it?</li>
<li>Does social-mcp contain an official-API implementation we can port?</li=
>
<li>Is there an official OpenAPI/spec/SDK we can compile into a Monid conne=
ctor?</li>
</ol>
<p>Our work for a platform should ideally be only:</p>
<ul>
<li>effect connector identity</li>
<li>readback connector identity</li>
<li>claim schema</li>
<li>ProofSpec/judges</li>
<li>independence policy</li>
<li>authority requirements</li>
<li>adversarial fixtures</li>
</ul>
<p>That is where QP=E2=80=99s product value lives.</p>
